"なにかと一緒にいる主人公に好意を寄せていて……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「もぉ、仕方ないなぁ。でも、お礼はちゃんと倍返し…だからね？」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜欢照顾人，待人温柔，在班上女生中拥有很高的人望的女孩子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容易被推上一些麻烦事这点和主人公一样。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"对经常步调一致的主人公渐渐抱有好意……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「真是的，真是没办法呢。但是，恩情一定要加倍返还……哟？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"38672"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"喜欢的食物","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"38672","value":"可丽饼，蛋包饭"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1466","sourceWorkId":"18869","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"e","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1466","sourceWorkId":"18869","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"156 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1466","sourceWorkId":"18869","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1466","sourceWorkId":"18869","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1466","sourceWorkId":"18869","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd58aba99985bb92a2ed84b6b2934e23c9424c04c9e3875f4b0a2cf167823a86.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e8e6863bbfd4109eb82873bc6e87f447476413cf9af318bdbf208158dc86658f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柚原みう","creatorId":"vndb:s977","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s977","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s977","name":"柚原 みう","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:73127:38672:15162:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c18825","characterName":"猫屋敷 ぺるしゃ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"38673","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"73127"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1467"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18825"},"originalCharacterName":"猫屋敷 ぺるしゃ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1102"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"104"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"K"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite Food: pasta"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Skills: acting, singing, dancing"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A friend of Mike’s who comes from a rich family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Usually refined and elegant, she has a mischievous side to her, too. She has a motherly nature and also ends up falling for our helpless protagonist. Not long after, she decides to confess."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But she does this at the exact same time as Mike and Ameri..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18825"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"名家のお嬢様で美華の友人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はお淑やかだけど、ちょっとイタズラ好きな女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母性的な性格から、頼りない主人公を慕うようになり、あることを切っ掛けに告白を決意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でも美華やあめりと同じタイミングだったから……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ケンカはいけません。仲良くしましょうね。 マスターのことも、みんなで仲良く……ねっ？」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"名家大小姐，美华的朋友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平时总是温柔娴淑的样子，但有点喜欢恶作剧的女孩子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格充满母性，慢慢倾慕靠不住的主人公，以某件事情为契机决意告白。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但是却不巧是和美华及あめり同样的时间……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「吵架可不好。大家要好好相处哦。店长的事情也是，大家一起好好地……哦？」"}],"source":"bangumi","s