"64"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite Food: meat"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Skills: athleticism, horse riding"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Persia's onee-sama. A very talented woman, she became the vice-principal at a very young age. She is extremely harsh, a sadistic demon woman. All the teachers at her school including the headmaster fears her, but she loves spoiling her students especially Persia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18827"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ぺるしゃの姉。 若くして上根子坂学園の教頭に就任した才媛。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は極めてキツく、ドエスな女王様。 学園では校長・他の教師たちにも恐れられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、妹のぺるしゃや学生たちには激甘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"制服フェチで妹フェチ、自覚はないけど変態さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「学生達。そして、ぺるしゃに何かあれば……あなたの血の色を確かめることになります」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ぺるしゃ的姐姐。年纪轻轻就就任上根子坂学园教导主任的才女。性格极其严厉，抖S的女王大人。在校内被包括校长在内的其他老师畏惧。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"然而，对ぺるしゃ和其他学生极其溺爱。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"制服控兼妹控，虽然没有自觉但确实是个变态小姐。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「要是学生们，还有ぺるしゃ发生了什么情况的话……就让我来确认一下你的血是什么颜色的吧」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"38675"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"99 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1470","sourceWorkId":"18869","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"h","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1470","sourceWorkId":"18869","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"170 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1470","sourceWorkId":"18869","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1470","sourceWorkId":"18869","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"64 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1470","sourceWorkId":"18869","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images